{
 "name": "look-v1",
 "description": "Workspace look (contracts/look.md). default: Automatic colour + letter for a name. me_patch: PATCH /v1/me with look fields on relay and publish (stored/after = the workspace record's icon, color, look_by). admin_patch: the look part of PATCH /admin/api/workspaces/<id>. render: what a surface shows for raw server values (phone, portals, dashboard). connect: what the core does on connect (local = .orch/config.toml [workspace] icon/color plus set_by from the orch home look-set-by.json, remote = whoami; write_local.set_by goes to look-set-by.json, never config.toml). me_patch.service: relay or publish (publish also takes show_on_shared_pages). meta: GET /f/<id>/meta on publish. local_set: `orch look set` / the dashboard against .orch/config.toml [workspace] icon, color and set_by = look_set_by from the orch home look-set-by.json, keyed by the workspace path (caller agent|human). connect.write_local.set_by: the adopted admin look counts as the person's pick. shared_pages_set: the core's rule for show_on_shared_pages, kept per machine in the orch home shared-pages.json (caller agent|human).",
